From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nds-ports <nds-ports@localhost>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add the DS touch screen

The view fills the top screen. hud_nds.c has the game draw the touch
screen: weapon cells with their pickup pictures and ammo, the overhead
map and the game's own status bar, drawn as if the view were small. Only
what changed is drawn again and copied to VRAM. Tapping a weapon selects
it, the inventory box uses the item, the map zooms. Outside of a level
and in the menus the touch screen shows the controls.
---
